<div class="prose-club">
  <p>At Penn Golf Club we know that enjoying our fine course is only part of your day. Before or after your round you can expect a warm and friendly welcome from our team.</p>
  <p>We offer an extensive menu of top-quality home-cooked food at very reasonable prices. If the daily specials aren't tempting enough, our <strong>themed nights</strong> are great value and bring a real buzz to the clubhouse.</p>
  <p>We specialise in <strong>traditional ales</strong> and always have something special on tap.</p>
  <p>Whether you're visiting for a special occasion, as a small group or with a large society, we'll look after you. Food is available all day, every day: have breakfast before your golf, a light snack or full meal afterwards, or both! No request is too much trouble.</p>
  <p>We host regular social events throughout the year. Keep an eye on the <a href="/diary/">diary</a> and <a href="/news/">news</a> for what's coming up.</p>
</div>
